── verdict ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
F5 / R11: PASS — a cross-tenant read is refused end to end, in a real browser,
against the deployed artifact, and the refusal is now auditable in every shape it
comes in. One probe defect (TLS) and one probe defect (browser-console
observability) were fixed in the probe; one real observability gap was fixed in
the product.
